        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-9"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "风致：美的姿态。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-10"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "梵婀（ē）玲：英语violin的音译，即小提琴。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-11"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "一例：一概，一律。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-12"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "艳歌：专门咏唱男女爱情的歌曲。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-13"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "风流：这里指年轻男女不拘礼法地表露自己的爱情。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-14"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "梁元帝：南朝梁代皇帝萧绎（508—554）。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-15"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "妖童媛（yuàn）女，荡舟心许：艳丽的少男和美貌的少女，摇着小船互相默默地传情。妖，艳丽。心许，默许。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-16"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "鹢（yì）首徐回，兼传羽杯：船慢慢地来回摇荡着，双方传递着酒杯。鹢首，古时画鹢于船头，所以把船头叫“鹢首”。鹢，水鸟。兼，指双方。羽杯，酒器。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-17"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "棹（zhào）将移而藻挂，船欲动而萍开：桨要划动，却被水草挂着；船要移动，就把浮萍分开了。棹，船桨。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-18"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "尔其纤腰束素，迁延顾步：那细细的腰肢，裹着洁白的绸子，走走停停，不住地回视自己的动作。尔其，那。顾，回头看。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-19"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "敛裾：提着衣襟。裾，衣襟。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-20"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "消受：享受。多用于否定式。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-21"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "text": "《西洲曲》：南朝乐府诗，描写青年女子思念意中人的痛苦。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "noteId": "footnote-11152-22"
    }
  ],
